ight: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.8" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260508/202605082325476988_720.jpg" alt="" src="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260508/202605082325476988_720.jpg"> </div><p>【比赛战报】</p><p>夺沙王冠！新月2-1逆转拉斯永恒 特奥贴地斩 N·多萨里破门</p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.75" data="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260509/zhanbao_image_1948755_1778269288_gray.jpeg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.75" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.75" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260509/zhanbao_image_1948755_1778269288_gray.jpeg" alt="" src="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260509/zhanbao_image_1948755_1778269288_gray.jpeg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51);">利雅得新月2-1逆转拉斯永恒，夺得沙王冠冠军！多萨里、特奥为新月进球。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-09/match1718943date2026vnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">多特3-2法兰克福 18岁伊纳西奥处子球拜尔助攻双响吉拉西破门</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.72" data="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260509/zhanbao_image_1718943_1778271792_gray.jpeg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.72" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.72" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260509/zhanbao_image_1718943_1778271792_gray.jpeg" alt="" src="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260509/zhanbao_image_1718943_1778271792_gray.jpeg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51);">多特3-2法兰克福。积分榜方面，多特70分第二，法兰克福43分第八。</span></p><p>【皇马公布冲突事件处罚】</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-08/69fdfd257953fnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">皇马官方：巴尔韦德与琼阿梅尼已相互道歉，两人各被罚款50万欧元</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.56" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260508/202605082325229121.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.56" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.56" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260508/202605082325229121.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260508/202605082325229121.jpg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">皇马官方发布处罚决定，宣布对队内冲突的巴尔韦德与琼阿梅尼各罚款50万欧元。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-09/69fe0b75c0b66native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">琼阿梅尼发文：接受俱乐部的处罚，已向全队道歉也想向球迷们致歉</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.33" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260508/69fd75046ce51.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.33" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.33" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260508/69fd75046ce51.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260508/69fd75046ce51.jpg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">在皇马官方公布对琼阿梅尼、巴尔韦德冲突的处罚后，琼阿梅尼更新社媒道歉。</span></p><p>【转会新闻】</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-08/69fdfe7e485acnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">葡萄牙CNN独家：种种迹象表明，穆里尼奥将在下赛季执教皇马</a></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-08/69fe015346ae9native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">解约金300万！球报：穆帅与皇马直接谈判 留本菲卡可能性越来越小</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260108/695ed8a1b102a.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260108/695ed8a1b102a.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260108/695ed8a1b102a.jpg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">葡萄牙CNN独家称，穆帅将在今夏执教皇马。葡媒《球报》也报道，穆里尼奥与皇马正在展开直接谈判，他留在本菲卡的可能性越来越小。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-09/69fe0f5ae43fenative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">慢镜头：米兰可能愿以6000万欧卖莱奥，但希望避免卖给竞争对手</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.54" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260103/6958400290b54.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.54" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.54" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260103/6958400290b54.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260103/6958400290b54.jpg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">意媒慢镜头发文，阿莱格里希望留下普利西奇。而莱奥则已经被放入转会市场。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-08/69fe021e35876native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">记者：拜仁接近与莱默尔达成续约，新合同年薪涨至1200万欧</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260116/696a21b82952c.jpeg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260116/696a21b82952c.jpeg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260116/696a21b82952c.jpeg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">记者Philipp Kessler报道，拜仁慕尼黑与莱默尔接近达成续约协议，他目前的合同为2027年到期。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-09/69fe1bd266341native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">世体：芝加哥火焰给莱万开总价1500万欧年薪，最高可达2000万欧</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_251217/6941e2b41eea0_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_251217/6941e2b41eea0.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_251217/6941e2b41eea0.jpg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">世界体育报消息，美职联球队芝加哥火焰给莱万开出了1500万欧年薪的合同，加上奖金等细节，总价最高可达2000万欧年薪。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-09/69fe37f1a4117native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">队报：格林伍德与贝纳蒂亚等人关系破裂，可能离队</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_250420/6804b4b086f23.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_250420/6804b4b086